<title>JAPAN: Murdoch expresses intention to buy LA Dodgers - Jiji.</title>
<headline>Murdoch expresses intention to buy LA Dodgers - Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media tycoon Rupert Murdoch, the president of News Corp, has expressed an intention to buy American professional baseball team the Los Angeles Dodgers, Japan's Jiji news agency reported on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
